              "content": "2. What is found inside intestines?",
              "options": [
                "Books",
                "Students",
                "Food",
                "Electronics"
              ],
              "correctAnswer": "C",
              "explanation": "c. Food"
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "content": "3. If you replenish an empty refrigerator, you",
              "options": [
                "turn the temperature down",
